{%- comment -%}
  Outputs the product's "Hide on this product" choices as one string,
  like |Size|Also Nice| , for `contains` checks. Capture it:
    {% capture kt_hidden %}{% render 'kt-hidden-list', product_resource: product %}{% endcapture %}
  The field (custom.hidden_sections) can be a list of "Product section"
  entries (metaobjects, picked from a list in admin) or a list of text.
{%- endcomment -%}
|
{%- for item in product_resource.metafields.custom.hidden_sections.value -%}
  {{- item.name.value | default: item -}}|
{%- endfor -%}
